    <briefdescription>
<para>TurbulenceModel-factory wrapper for k-omega SST. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Owns k, omega and nut; reads them from disk in the constructor, delegates physics to <ref refid="classNeoFOAM_1_1KOmegaSST" kindref="compound">KOmegaSST</ref>. Registered as &quot;kOmegaSST&quot; in the <ref refid="classNeoFOAM_1_1TurbulenceModel" kindref="compound">TurbulenceModel</ref> factory so <ref refid="classNeoFOAM_1_1TurbulenceModel_1a49dee8641d6055c7fa2b88be94e8448a" kindref="member">TurbulenceModel::create()</ref> can instantiate it from a RAS turbulenceProperties block. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
